import lemmas.Compiler.CompRunHintKS

/-!
# The hint cases of `+run`: the kept dynamic tag (README Gaps 25)

`[11 [tag h] q]` with `tag` `hint-dynamic` (`%spot` of `!:`, `%slog`,
`%hunk`, `%hand`, `%lose`, `%mean`, `%spin`, `%jinx`, `%live`, `%bout`,
`%xray`): `+simple-next`, `+past-if` over `q`, a fresh register `toke`,
the epilogue `[%hde tag toke body]`, `q` under `%next` to it,
`+lazy-bound`, the prologue `[%hdp tag toke body]`, the clue `h` under
`[%next (lazy-from-reg toke) ~ prol]`, `+copy` with the bound need.  The
branch `cr11DKept` is cut at its pushes (`cdHead`, `cdP1` from `+past-if`,
`cdP4` from the run of `q`, `cdP7` from the run of `h`;
`tools/gen/runhintk.py`).

* `cr11_dkept`: `crK11` on a dynamic tag is `cr11DKept`.
* `cd_p7`, `cd_p4`, `cd_p1`: the parts, against any model `R` of `q`, `h`.
* **`comp_run_n11d_kept`**: the case on every goal against `runLCH env snd
  true msup`, from `SoundAt` of `q`, the links of `q` and `h` at the
  goals they get and the `CopyH` of the `+copy`.
-/

